	(text "PHY supplies (2-supply mode): 2.5V/500mA and 1.1V/300mA LDOs from +3V3.\nAll PHY rails ramp together from +3V3 (DP83869 sequencing: VDDIO within 50 ms of 1.1V/2.5V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 27.94 95.25 0)
		(effects
